## Conclusion

KNWM is designed to move beyond purely language-driven reasoning by building a structured, reusable, and executable knowledge system.

My work aims to support scientific understanding, prediction, knowledge reuse, problem-solving, and autonomous planning through a knowledge-neuron architecture.

This research is still evolving, but it presents a promising direction for AI systems that need to reason and act with structured knowledge rather than only pattern-based text generation.
